    "detailed_description": "Planet Eaters threaten the galaxy by eating planets. Planet Eater, which threatens the galaxy, is currently encroaching on the planet Fantasya to eat it.<br><br>Knowing this, the planetary protection agency Ndev dispatches Captain Mr.Bae, a specialized Planet Eater disposal team, to save the planet Fantasya. Help Mr.Bae save the planet Fantasya.<br><br><strong>\u25a0 Please level up and grow your crew members through the experience gained from clearing the stage.<br><br>\u25a0 A special container [Pandora] made to contain Planet Eaters can grant special powers to crew members.<br><br>\u25a0 Feel free to change the skills of the members according to the situation of each stage.</strong><br>Save the planet Fantasya from the Planet Eaters and keep the peace in the galaxy!",
